  "assessment_notes": [
    "EndpointTrace is a structural policy predicate over actual current occurrence indices, current lengths and stepRun children, ending at a singleton. It contains no distinctness, target, probability or resource assumption. Target existence and valid rank are derived from actual step semantics.",
    "The private recursive endpoint_outcome covers arbitrary linear-order payloads, every distinct list and each valid zero-based worker rank. Empty contradicts validity; singleton has an actual supported cost9 result. A nonsingleton actual endpoint transition removes exactly one occurrence, preserves distinctness and the rank target, and recursively uses k-1 (saturating at0). The length decrease comes from actual stepRun_child.",
    "Exact outcome probability is derived with run_child_atom and the factorial identity; the predicate does not assume probability. Positive factorial mass supplies support; fixed-initial-state supported-trace injection transfers exact1/n! to the projected trace event. Trace length n and2W=n(n+1) are proved inductively. Correct value and W<=T<=9W+2 use actual run observations.",
    "Natural ranges supply every positive size without assuming an arbitrary payload type is infinite. Every valid rank is retained. The actual source observation satisfies n^2<=2T andT<=11n^2. The unbounded theorem chooses n before all valid ranks and derives cost>B from actual initial scan and source lower bounds, with no abstract assigned runtime.",
    "Checked clients consume the general witness to establish maximum scan volume over all actual supported outcomes, both endpoint ranks on an unsorted list, range4 bounds, and an unbounded positive trace event with an actual source-cost witness. Concrete interior paths cover unsorted3 input W6/T33/probability1/6 and signed5 input W15/T67/probability1/120. Range4 rank2 actual path has W10/T48/probability1/24.",
    "Boundary clients prove that empty and invalid executions remain actual total laws without a successful EndpointTrace, all-equal3 has W3 and occurrence trace mass1/3, and mixed duplicates [1,1,2] can satisfy the structural endpoint predicate with W4/T23/probability1/3. Thus distinctness is necessary for the factorial/triangular claim and scan volume is not silently equated with source calls.",
    "All25 full explicit actual types retain precisely these hypotheses, domains and quantifier order; no accidental generalized probability/resource premise, independence assumption or weakened universal rank scope was found."
  ],
